# 统一行尾策略 —— 根因修复
#
# 背景：Windows 全局 core.autocrlf=true 会把工作区检出为 CRLF，
# 而 prettier 的 format:check 按 LF 重新格式化，导致一批"看着已格式化、
# 检查却失败"的假报错。.gitattributes 的优先级高于 core.autocrlf，
# 在此显式声明后，仓库内所有文本文件在工作区与索引中都是 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换 ----
*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary
*.lib   binary
*.pdb   binary
*.nupkg binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary

# ---- 明确为文本（避免被上面规则或自动探测误判）----
*.cs      text
*.csproj  text
*.sln     text
*.props   text
*.targets text
*.xaml    text
*.ts      text
*.tsx     text
*.vue     text
*.js      text
*.mjs     text
*.cjs     text
*.json    text
*.jsonc   text
*.yml     text
*.yaml    text
*.md      text
*.css     text
*.scss    text
*.html    text
*.ps1     text
*.cmd     text
*.bat     text
*.sh      text
*.py      text
*.iss     text
*.config  text
*.manifest text

# ---- 锁定文件：永不手工合并 ----
package-lock.json  -diff linguist-generated=true
